    skos:prefLabel 'Sea-Bird Scientific SBE Surface Temperature and Salinity sensor'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The SBE Surface Temperature and Salinity (STS) sensor is designed to make near-surface temperature and conductivity measurements from profiling floats. As its conductivity sensor is free-flushed, the SBE STS is designed to be used in conjunction with an SBE 41CP sensor for calibration purposes.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:R27::SBE_STS'^^xsd:string .
